h out to the Democrats, who will have a majority; speaks about who would be brought into his administration in a non-partisan cabinet; states he would like Secretary of Defense Robert Gates to stay on for a while; reiterates Obama would tax half of small businesses and to raise anyone taxes in this economy would a terrible thing; downplays the losing scenario: that we have fought the good fight; asserts we are coming back strong; says Governor Sarah Palin would be a national figure; notes he is not good at asking for money.]  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson)  The standings of Obama and McCain in the latest four-day ABC News/\"Washington Post\" tracking poll cited.  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson; Washington: George Stephanopoulos)  What the McCain campaign has been saying about the polling and the undecided voters discussed. ", "segment_duration": 640, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 910012, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "jsxSj2Sn7S", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-31", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 910011, "segment_id": "8oynsFPMPC", "segment_broadcast_id": "jsxSj2Sn7S", "segment_title": "Stock Market Report (Studio: Charles Gibson)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63690.0", "legacy_segment_id": 910013, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "jsxSj2Sn7S", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-31", "